# Settings this version adds that must keep their old behaviour on existing cores (PLAN.md 8).
#
# An update adds each key=value line to state/settings if the key is missing there, so an existing
# core keeps behaving as before while new installations get the default from settings.defaults.
# Example: a new setting gateway_tls with the default true for new installations would be listed
# here as gateway_tls=false. Keys are only ever added, never removed.
